Package: peakAge
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Latent Peak-Age Models for Athlete Performance
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("K.Ken", "Peng",
           email = "kangyi_peng@sfu.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bayesian hierarchical models for estimating athletes' peak age
    and performance trajectories using symmetric and asymmetric latent
    peak-performance curves. The package supports athlete-level covariates,
    population-level effects, and Bayesian uncertainty quantification via
    posterior summaries and visualizations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/KenKPeng/peakAge
